chos, 10/10 para jugarlo con amigos", "timestamp_created": 1709229280, "timestamp_updated": 1709229280, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159552032", "author": {"steamid": "76561198095143188", "personaname": "ICRA", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/icra77/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 7292, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 103, "playtime_at_review": 2501, "last_played": 1787731873, "avatar": "7b2a0e971fc29320749862670c6cbe9769893a87"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Hace pium pium", "timestamp_created": 1709227861, "timestamp_updated": 1715127986, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159550036", "author": {"steamid": "76561198315897081", "personaname": "KingOfBros7", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198315897081/", "num_games_owned": 87, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 5345, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 912, "last_played": 1770698318, "avatar": "629dd1a33beda077a72896de0285378b6bddb34b"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Es de los juegos mas divertidos que he jugado de forma cooperativa, extrañaba reirme así con mis amigos, cada partida nos ocurre algo diferente y es entretenido ver como cooperamos para repartir justicia y democracia a través de toda la galaxia. Me encanta que el pase de batalla es gratis, trae bastantes cosmeticos y armas utiles para el juego. Por otra parte el pase premium se puede conseguir de forma totalmente gratuita juntando super creditos del pase y encontrandolos in game. (Cosa que me parece maravillosa). Al día de hoy 28 de febrero no he tenido ningun problema con los servidores. Entro sin problema a las partidas. Espero que sigan actualizando con contenido este juego porque tiene todo el potencial para convertirse en juego multijugador del año!!", "timestamp_created": 1709225863, "timestamp_updated": 1709225863, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159548510", "author": {"steamid": "76561198037641996", "personaname": "Drakensis", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198037641996/", "num_games_owned": 532, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 8234, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1394, "last_played": 1724359893, "avatar": "752eb38c3b0bc6f74708ec2c3d44d00bda41edde"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Muy buen juego, muy adictivo, simple, divertido, complicado y dificil si asi lo requieres. Espero la comunidad no se vuelva toxica.", "timestamp_created": 1709224294, "timestamp_updated": 1709224294, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159537994", "author": {"steamid": "76561198075281870", "personaname": "MashTyx", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Mushticks/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 10929, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9736, "last_played": 1756586562, "avatar": "f4f2fc58620a769dfcc51defda89ed5cb8fa7d75"}, "language": "latam", "review": "\n", "timestamp_created": 1709214018, "timestamp_updated": 1727534072, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159536700", "author": {"steamid": "76561198130320052", "personaname": "el kai", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/el_kai/", "num_games_owned": 176, "num_reviews": 43, "playtime_forever": 18794, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1250, "playtime_at_review": 17279, "last_played": 1787790708, "avatar": "8a181c56d492554ccb7fe5a22730d2cb13a00f50"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Antes, cuando el mundo era más agradable, cuando el sol brillaba cada día y el viento cantaba, este juego era así de bueno, pero luego la nación de los desarrolladores que se confunden llegó, con la llegada de otra player base creyendo que podían cambiar la formula original pero solo hicieron desastre, no queres su tontería de la \"grunt fantasy\", queremos el juego que nos prometieron, dijeron ellos \"power fantasy\" en su momento y así lo publicitaron, sin embargo todo eso se nos fue quitado y no poco a poco,,,, nerfeos a armas, a sistemas, buffeos enormes a los enemigos, no volver atrás en sus palabras, usualmente somos jugadores contra publishers, no puedo creer que esta vez sea devs contra jugadores...", "timestamp_created": 1709212836, "timestamp_updated": 1778765758, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159532566", "author": {"steamid": "76561199181622561", "personaname": "KrustGamer DLC", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199181622561/", "num_games_owned": 163, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 7240, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1090, "last_played": 1786152735, "avatar": "a25eda00a63a80c3e8434b7327c840d2a205260f"}, "language": "latam", "review": "El mejor juego que compré y jugué", "timestamp_created": 1709208249, "timestamp_updated": 1709208249, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.518072307109832764", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 8, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "159523982", "author": {"steamid": "76561198424747273", "personaname": "Art", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ArtBorlan99/", "num_games_owned": 287, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 10375, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 879, "last_played": 1748678045, "avatar": "7b3137325f258c22f9ea50a1bb677da7060b670d"}, "language": "latam", "review": "¡Helldivers, el juego donde tus amigos pueden ser tus peores enemigos y tus mejores aliados, todo en un abrir y cerrar de ojos! Es como un picnic en el espacio exterior, pero en lugar de canastas de comida, tienes armas láser y granadas. Si alguna vez te has preguntado cómo sería luchar contra una horda intergaláctica de insectos gigantes mientras gritas órdenes a tus amigos y, al mismo tiempo, te tropiezas con tus propias minas terrestres, entonces Helldivers es el juego para ti. ¡Prepárate para reír, llorar y jurar venganza contra ese amigo que siempre llama al refuerzo justo cuando estás a punto de desactivar la bomba! En resumen, Helldivers es como un 